`S1 a b c` = `0^inf A> 0^7 (1000)^a 0000 1 00000 1 000 (10)^b (00100000100000)^c J` (odd phases; step 824,136 from
blank is `S1 80 219 59`), `T2 a x y c` = `0^inf A> 0^7 (1000)^a 0000 1 00000 1 000 (10)^x 0 (01)^y
(00000001000001)^c 000 101` (second part of even phases; step 238,964 is `T2 26 92 36 34`), `T3 a x d y z c` =
`0^inf A> 0^7 (1000)^a (10)^x (0010)^d (10)^y 0000 1 00000 1 000 (10)^z (00100000100000)^c J` (first part of even
phases; step 197,036 is `T3 5 14 23 8 7 44`).

* `cycle`: `S1 a (b+2) (c+2)` reaches `S1 (a+3) (b+14) c` in `80a + 72b + 1356` steps;
* `cycle2`: `T2 a (x+6) (y+6) (c+2)` reaches `T2 (a+3) (x+13) (y+11) c`;
